WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:17.100
♪ SHOWER THE PEOPLE YOU LOVE WITH LOVE  ♪

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.680
♪ SHOW THEM THE WAY THAT YOU FEEL ♪

00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:25.213
♪
LIVE LONG LIKE HE WOULD, BIG

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.400
SMILES.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.533
BIG HEART.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.980
BIG SERVICE, ALL LOVE.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:39.340
OFFICER SEAN COLLIER WE LOVE
YOU.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:46.340
THE INSTITUTE CONVENED A
COMMITTEE TO THINK ABOUT A

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:50.200
MEMORIAL FOR SEAN COLLIER.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:55.800
THE FIGURE OF THE MEMORIAL IS A
KIND OF FIVE-WALL STRUCTURE

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.880
EXTRUDED.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.860
AND THEN A VOID IS ACTUALLY
CARVED OUT OF IT.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:03.793
AND THAT VOID REPRESENTS A KIND
OF ABSENCE OR LOSS.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:11.747
THE FORM ITSELF IS BASED ON THE
HAND REPRESENTING BOTH A KIND OF

00:01:11.747 --> 00:01:14.007
GESTURE OF OPENNESS TO OTHERS.

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:18.927
BUT ALSO THE ABILITY TO APPLY
ONE'S SELF TO MAKE THINGS

00:01:18.927 --> 00:01:21.853
BETTER.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:25.740
WE WANTED THE STONE TO BE
REPRESENTATIVE OF THE PLACES

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:31.260
WHERE SEAN SPENT A LOT OF TIME,
LIKE THE MIT OUTING CLUB, SO WE

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.493
THOUGHT OF GRANITE, NEW
HAMPSHIRE.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:42.354
THE MEMORIAL IS MADE OF 32
BLOCKS WHICH PIECE TOGETHER IN A

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:46.660
WAY THAT ALLOWS EACH BLOCK TO
HOLD THE OTHER ONE UP.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.880
I WILL GO AROUND AND GET THE
OTHER TWO.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.880
SO IT'S STRENGTH COMES FROM
UNITY.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:55.620
ITS STRENGTH COMES FROM THE
MANY, AS OPPOSED TO A SINGULAR

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:56.120
 

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:56.800
GESTURE.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.140
SO HERE IT'S 90 AND A HALF

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:01.140
AND HERE IS 91 AND A HALF

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.060
PEOPLE DON'T BUILD ANYMORE
THIS WAY.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.660
SO IT'S AN EXPERIMENT IN USING
REALLY OLD-FASHIONED TECHNIQUES

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.080
OF STONE MASONRY.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:14.160
SORT OF PRE-MODERN BUT USING
HIGH-END COMPUTERS TO DETERMINE

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.393
SHAPES AND LAY-OUT OF THE
STONES.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:23.180
WE ARE SAYING THIS IS A-1,
IT'S GREAT, IT'S PERFECT.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:29.220
THE FIVE WALLS ACTUALLY
EXTEND OUT FROM THE CENTER VOID

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:34.413
AS THEY EXTEND OUT THEY FRAME
VERY SPECIFIC VIEWS.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:39.787
THE TWO WALLS CLOSEST
TOGETHER ALIGN WITH A LOCATION

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.880
OF SEAN'S CRUISER WHERE HE WAS
SHOT.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:47.520
IT'S THE MOST INTIMATE SPACE IN
THE MEMORIAL.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:51.120
WHEN YOU WERE UNDER IT FRAMES
EXACTLY THAT SPOT WHERE THE

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.220
TRAGEDY OCCURRED.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:59.880
WHAT WE REALLY HAVE IS FIVE
HALF ARCHES EACH LEANING IN

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:00.947
TOWARDS THE MIDDLE.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:06.120
WHILE THAT HALF ARCH SHOULD FALL
OVER, THERE IS ANOTHER HALF ARCH

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.340
SOMEWHERE ELSE LEANING IN AND
ANOTHER HALF ARCH, EACH ARE

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:12.560
COMING TOGETHER, AND BALANCING, IN THE MIDDLE.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:15.240
SO THE ARCH IS EXERTING AN OUTWARD FORCE

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:20.960
AND THE FIVE WALLS ARE A
BUTTRESSING THE CENTER PART OF A

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.527
VERY FLAT VAULT.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:28.480
AS THE ARCHES PUSH OUT WARDS ON
THE WALLS, THE WALLS WANT TO

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:32.914
SPREAD OUT, AND BURIED
UNDERGROUND IS A TENSION TIE

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:38.000
WHICH IS PULLING TOWARDS THE CENTER AND
PULLING THE WHOLE MEMORIAL

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.760
TOGETHER SO IT'S AN EQUILIBRIUM.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:46.940
BELOW GROUND THERE IS A GRADE BEAM WHICH IS POURED IN CONCRETE

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:50.860
AND IT'S REINFORCED CONCRETE SO THERE IS STEEL EMBEDDED IN

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.960
WHICH CARRIES THE TENSILE FORCES

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.580
TO ENSURE THAT THE
WALLS WILL NOT MOVE OUTWARD OVER

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.714
THE CENTURIES.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:03.440
THE OUTSIDE OF THE SCULPTURE
IS ALL GOING TO BE A FLAMED FINISH.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:08.800
THIS IS A FINE GRAIN AND DENSE
GRANITE, BUT LEAVES A FLAT BUT

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:13.640
A MORE NATURAL TEXTURED SURFACE.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:18.300
EACH STONE IS CUT WITH
ADVANCED MILLING TECHNOLOGY AND

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.340
SOME STONES ARE CUT BY ROBOTS.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:25.807
AND THE ACCURACY OF EACH STONE
IS WITHIN ONE MILLIMETER.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:34.200
EVEN AS THE ROBOT IS CARVING
THE BLOCKS, SOMEONE HAS TO TAP

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:39.500
EVERY SINGLE PIECE AND BREAK IT
OFF ONE BY ONE, BEFORE THE ROBOT

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.500
CAN COME IN FOR ITS FINAL PASS.

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:47.373
IT WAS A KIND OF INCREDIBLE
DANCE BETWEEN LIKE MACHINE AND

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:56.013
MAN TO CARVE THESE PIECES.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:05:00.720
IT'S LIKE A THREE-DIMENSIONAL
JIGSAW PUZZLE WITH FINELY

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:02.720
POLISHED BLOCKS OF GRANITE.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:07.267
BUT IN THIS CASE THEY WEIGH ABOUT 10,000 POUNDS EACH.

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:16.920
MY NAME IS ROB ROGERS, A PROJECT
MANAGER FOR SUFFOLK CONSTRUCTION

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.587
AND I'M ALSO SEAN COLLIER'S BROTHER.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:24.393
THERE IS A SEQUENCE OF HOW WE ARE GOING TO LOWER THE STONES.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:29.867
SO, IN THEORY, THE STONES SHOULD LOCK IN PLACE.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:38.080
WHEN THE FIRST BLOCKS ARRIVED
AND STARTED TO TAKE PHYSICAL

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.740
FORM, AS AN ARCHITECT THAT'S THE
MAGICAL MOMENT.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:46.620
WHEN A CONCEPT TURNS INTO
PHYSICAL REALITY.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:51.660
THERE WERE MANY TIMES IN THIS
WHOLE PROJECT WHERE WE HAD TO

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.760
KEEP OUR EMOTIONS IN CHECK.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:58.000
BECAUSE IT WAS SUCH AN
EMOTIONAL PROJECT FOR EVERYONE INVOLVED

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:12.167
IT'S BEEN VERY HUMBLING AND HEALING, YOU KNOW, IN THE PAST

00:06:12.167 --> 00:06:14.667
ALMOST TWO YEARS SINCE SEAN IS
GONE.

00:06:14.667 --> 00:06:18.560
IT'S HELPED A LOT.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:23.760
WE STARTED WITH THE KEYSTONE
AND WE HAD TO BUILD A TEMPORARY

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:31.100
SCAFFOLD UNDER THAT KEYSTONE AND
THEN THE RING STONES CAME IN

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:36.767
NEXT, AND WE SEQUENTIALLY WENT
THROUGH EACH OF THE FIVE LEGS.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:41.053
THIS HAS PROBABLY BEEN THE HARDEST
SEASON TO BUILD IN.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:46.040
WE HAVE 109 INCHES, WORSE
WINTER EVER IN BOSTON.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.980
IT MADE THINGS MORE CHALLENGING.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:50.813
BUT EVERYONE ON SITE WAS GREAT.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:54.680
WE KNEW WE HAD AN END DATE AND
WE NEED TO MEET THIS DATE.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.346
SO GUYS WORKED HARDER AND
LONGER.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:03.300
THE MOST EXCITING MOMENT AND
THE MOST CRITICAL MOMENT IN THE

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:09.200
CONSTRUCTION IS WHEN WE LOWER
THE SCAFFOLDING AND THE WEIGHT OF THE KEYSTONE

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:14.020
AND THE VAULT GO INTO THE FIVE
WALLS FOR THE FIRST TIME.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:24.780
WE HAVE INSTRUMENTS FOR
DISPLACEMENTS IN 25 DIFFERENT LOCATIONS

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:27.220
AND THEN WE HAVE GOT 9 SCALES
UNDERNEATH IT

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.380
TAKING LOAD READINGS

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:30.900
SO WE ARE GOING TO BE DOING REAL-TIME MEASUREMENTS

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.780
OF HOW THE LOAD IS BEING TRANSFERRED.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:35.913
WE WILL START WITH THE FOUR
MIDDLE ONES.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:42.247
AS WE LOWER THE TEMPORARY
SUPPORTS AND THEY COME DOWN, THE

00:07:42.247 --> 00:07:44.307
LOAD ON THE SCALE SHOULD COME
DOWN.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:48.440
AND THE LOAD ON THE SCALES WILL BE
GOING DOWN BECAUSE THE WEIGHT OF

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.840
THE STONES ARE GOING ON ARCHING.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:53.500
IF WE LOWER THE SUPPORTS AND THE
READING ON THE SCALE DOESN'T

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.680
CHANGE, THAT'S BAD.

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:55.680
ONE
TWO

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:56.847
THREE.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.953
WOW, BABY.

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:05.420
THAT'S GREAT.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:11.360
[APPLAUSE]

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:18.147
SO BEHIND "B" LEG IS A LITTLE
PART OF MY SPEECH THAT I GAVE

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:19.760
FOR SEAN.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:23.360
SO THEY ENGRAVED IT ON TO THE
STONE.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:26.640
SO LIVE LONG LIKE HE WOULD, BIG
HEARTS AND BIG SMILES AND BIG

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.907
SERVICE, ALL LOVE.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:35.360
HE WAS A JUST KID THAT LOVED BEING A COP, AND HAD A MILLION FRIENDS.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:39.560
I DON'T KNOW HOW HE SLEPT,
ALWAYS DOING SOMETHING AND

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:40.540
HANGING OUT WITH SOMEBODY.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.180
REALLY LIVED LIFE TO ITS
FULLEST.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:47.840
♪ SHOWER THE PEOPLE YOU LOVE WITH LOVE ♪

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.740
HE WAS MADE TO BE A POLICE
OFFICER, I KNOW THAT HIS MOTHER

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:52.740
SAID THAT HE WANTED TO BE A
POLICEMEN FROM THE TIME HE WAS

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:53.840
SEVEN YEARS OLD.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:58.506
AND IT SHOWED, IT SHOWED IN
EVERYTHING HE DID, HE GOT IT.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:03.220
IT'S A VERY OPEN STRUCTURE
FOR SOMETHING BUILT OUT OF SUCH

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:06.786
SOLID STONE, AND IT'S TO BE A
GATEWAY INTO CAMPUS.

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.900
THERE'S PEOPLE MILLING AROUND, THEY SPEND A LOT OF TIME IN NORTH COURT,

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:10.940
THEY LIKE TO BE OUTSIDE

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:14.420
SO WE HAVE THESE BENCHES AND
THERE WILL BE TREES.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:19.260
AND IT HOPEFULLY WILL BE A PLACE
THAT WE WILL ENJOY SITTING DOWN AND

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:21.560
SPENDING TIME WITH THEIR FRIENDS
AND THE COMMUNITY.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:28.754
I HOPE THAT THE MEMORIAL WILL
BECOME ONE OF THE BELOVED

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.793
ELEMENTS ON CAMPUS.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:35.847
HOPEFULLY IT CAN REMAIN FOR US
TO REMEMBER SEAN'S SERVICE AND

00:09:35.847 --> 00:09:37.773
THE COMING TOGETHER OF THE
COMMUNITY.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.200
AND OUR VALUES.

